cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "valiDATA: job validation tool pre-submission"
abstract: >-
  A terminal program (jobcheck) that shows the values that matter in the
  input files and scripts of a cluster job, and runs the submit command only
  once each of them has been confirmed. It marks what differs from the last
  submission, adds up the requested cores and core-hours, and logs every
  submission with its values.
